                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} Hom(F,G)
            indeed as the set of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/descent"} descent
            data for the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/sheaf"} sheaf
            condition on
            = succeed "." do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
